DICOM Standard excerpts

The JSON files in this directory hold tables from the DICOM Standard, as
generated by "pymedphys dev deid-tables". Each file's "table", "edition", and
"acknowledgement" fields name its source. The files are:

- e1_1.json: Table E.1-1, Application Level Confidentiality Profile
  Attributes, of DICOM PS3.15 2026d.

Source: DICOM PS3.15 2026d, © NEMA.

The DICOM Standard is under continuous maintenance, and the current official
version is available at http://www.dicomstandard.org

The National Electrical Manufacturers Association (NEMA) holds the copyright
in the DICOM Standard. These excerpts are not covered by the Apache License
2.0 or the MIT License that apply to the rest of PyMedPhys.

Each table is transcribed into JSON as one object per row, with the table's
columns as named fields. The transcription normalises whitespace, removes the
invisible formatting characters (such as zero-width spaces) that the
published pages use to break long words, records the Y and N columns as true
and false, and leaves out empty option cells. The text of every cell is
otherwise as published. Do not edit these files: regenerate them.


